<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="Y9I0TYlJnBepd41VNZ-e">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2110" dy="1600" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;%% Generic idempotency replay/conflict flow.\n%% Applies to any idempotency-keyed mutating endpoint in this platform:\n%%   - auth-service: POST /authorisations, POST /authorisations/{id}/captures,\n%%     POST /authorisations/{id}/reversals\n%%   - fraud-service: POST /fraud/check\n%% Scope key = (scopeId, idempotencyKey), e.g. (accountId, idempotencyKey) for authorise/fraud-check,\n%% or (authorisationId, idempotencyKey) for capture/reverse.\n%% Fingerprint = hash of the semantic request payload (see RequestHashing in shared-spring-lib),\n%% used to distinguish a safe replay from a conflicting reuse of the same key.\nsequenceDiagram\n\tautonumber\n\tactor Client\n\tparticipant Svc as Service\n\tparticipant Cache as Idempotency&lt;br/&gt;Cache (Redis)\n\tparticipant DB as Datastore&lt;br/&gt;(unique constraint on&lt;br/&gt;scopeId + idempotencyKey)\n\n\trect rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\n\t\tnote over Client, DB: 1) First request for this (scopeId, idempotencyKey)\n\t\tClient-&gt;&gt;Svc: Request A (scopeId,&lt;br/&gt;idempotencyKey=K, payload=P1)\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;Cache: get(scopeId, K)\n\t\tCache--&gt;&gt;Svc: miss\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: conditional insert (scopeId,&lt;br/&gt;K, fingerprint(P1))\n\t\tDB--&gt;&gt;Svc: inserted (0 prior rows)\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;Svc: execute business operation\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: persist result / domain event\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;Cache: store response (TTL)\n\t\tSvc--&gt;&gt;Client: 200 OK (result R1)\n\tend\n\n\trect rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\n\t\tnote over Client, DB: 2) Retry: same key + same payload -&gt; safe replay\n\t\tClient-&gt;&gt;Svc: Request B (scopeId,&lt;br/&gt;idempotencyKey=K, payload=P1)\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;Cache: get(scopeId, K)\n\t\talt Cache hit\n\t\t\tCache--&gt;&gt;Svc: cached response R1\n\t\t\tSvc--&gt;&gt;Client: 200 OK (replayed R1,&lt;br/&gt;no new side effect)\n\t\telse Cache miss (e.g. TTL expired)&lt;br/&gt;- fall back to durable store\n\t\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: find existing row by (scopeId, K)\n\t\t\tDB--&gt;&gt;Svc: existing row, fingerprint(P1) matches\n\t\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;Svc: rebuild response from persisted state\n\t\t\tSvc--&gt;&gt;Client: 200 OK (replayed R1,&lt;br/&gt;no new side effect)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\trect rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\n\t\tnote over Client, DB: 3) Retry: same key + different payload -&gt; conflict\n\t\tClient-&gt;&gt;Svc: Request C (scopeId,&lt;br/&gt;idempotencyKey=K, payload=P2 != P1)\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;Cache: get(scopeId, K)\n\t\tCache--&gt;&gt;Svc: cached response R1&lt;br/&gt;(fingerprint stored = fingerprint(P1))\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;Svc: compare fingerprint(P2) vs&lt;br/&gt;stored fingerprint(P1) -&gt; mismatch\n\t\tSvc--&gt;&gt;Client: 409 Conflict (IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT)\n\tend\n\n\trect rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\n\t\tnote over Client, DB: 4) Concurrent race: two first-time requests,&lt;br/&gt;same key, at the same time\n\t\tpar Request D (payload=P1)\n\t\t\tClient-&gt;&gt;Svc: Request D (scopeId, K, P1)\n\t\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: conditional insert (scopeId,&lt;br/&gt;K, fingerprint(P1))\n\t\tand Request E (payload=P1, concurrent)\n\t\t\tClient-&gt;&gt;Svc: Request E (scopeId, K, P1)\n\t\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: conditional insert (scopeId,&lt;br/&gt;K, fingerprint(P1))\n\t\tend\n\t\tDB--&gt;&gt;Svc: one insert wins, the other&lt;br/&gt;violates the unique constraint\n\t\tnote over Svc: Loser does not fail the request - it re-reads the winner&#39;s&lt;br/&gt;committed row instead of retrying the write\n\t\tSvc-&gt;&gt;DB: find committed row by (scopeId, K)\n\t\tDB--&gt;&gt;Svc: winner&#39;s row, fingerprint(P1)&lt;br/&gt;matches loser&#39;s payload\n\t\tSvc--&gt;&gt;Client: 200 OK (both callers observe&lt;br/&gt;the same result R1)\n\tend\n\n\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="BoGchFhTnOTgTzf14KKM-1">
